{
  "declaredLength": 1440,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "時時提供最優質的服務……\n歡迎光臨鼎極餐館。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6642664263D04F9B6700512A8CEA7684670D52D920262026000A6B618FCE514981E89F0E69759910992830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "敬請挑戰至高無上的全餐。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "656C8ACB6311623081F39AD871214E0A768451689910300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是鼎極，\n真的是頂級。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F9F0E6975FF0C000A771F7684662F98027D1A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我能享受這股滋味\n實在是太好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621180FD4EAB53D7901980A16ECB5473000A5BE65728662F592A597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能得出好結論就好了呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C80FD5F9751FA597D7D508AD65C31597D4E86546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟肚子空空會讓判斷失誤。\n得用最棒的料理填飽肚子才行。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF809A5B507A7A7A7A67038B93522465B759318AA43002000A5F977528670068D2768465997406586B98FD809A5B50624D884C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在對戰的世界\n可沒有所謂的絕對。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285C0D623076844E16754C000A53EF6C92670962408B0276847D555C0D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在對戰的姐姐和\n寶可夢超帥的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285C0D6230768459D059D0548C000A5BF653EF59228D855E257684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只靠著當一名寶可夢訓練家\n能活得下去嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA9760845775764E00540D5BF653EF59228A137DF45BB6000A80FD6D3B5F974E0B53BB55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是站在\n姐姐這邊的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F7AD95728000A59D059D09019908A768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "告訴你喔，公司裡有個討厭鬼，\n我真想用寶可夢對戰打飛那個人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "544A8A344F605594FF0C516C53F888E16709500B8A0E53AD9B3CFF0C000A6211771F60F375285BF653EF59225C0D6230625398DB90A3500B4EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喔喔原來如此，\n嗯嗯我懂妳喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55945594539F4F8659826B64FF0C000A55EF55EF621161C259B3559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "「奶油烤布蕾～極致～」\n實在太過頂級……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "300C59766CB970E45E03857EFF5E697581F4FF5E300D000A5BE65728592A904E98027D1A202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這焦糖化反應簡直是至高無上！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901971267CD6531653CD61C97C2176F4662F81F39AD871214E0AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聚集了寶可夢訓練家和\n美食家的店還真是厲害啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "805A96C64E865BF653EF59228A137DF45BB6548C000A7F8E98DF5BB676845E979084771F662F53B25BB3554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老闆克里斯托福說這裡是為了\n讓寶可夢對戰和食物都達到極致的地方。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……冷靜一想實在是不明所以呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800195C6514B91CC65AF6258798F8AAA901988E1662F70BA4E86000A8B935BF653EF59225C0D6230548C98DF726990FD90545230697581F47684573065B9300200100001BE00000A2026202651B7975C4E0060F35BE65728662F4E0D660E62404EE5546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本店不論是哪道料理\n都有最佳的品嚐時機。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C5E974E0D8AD6662F54EA905365997406000A90FD670967004F73768454C1569066426A5F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用完餐之後打寶可夢對戰\n這樣可以嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75285B8C99104E4B5F8C62535BF653EF59225C0D6230000A90196A2353EF4EE555CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟要了解彼此最好的方式\n就是來場寶可夢對戰了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF89814E8689E35F7C6B646700597D768465B95F0F000A5C31662F4F8658345BF653EF59225C0D62304E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了吃到只提供給貴賓的甜點，\n我鍛鍊了我的搭檔喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E865403523053EA63D04F9B7D668CB48CD37684751C9EDEFF0C000A6211935B934A4E8662117684642D6A94559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為我努力過頭了，\n所以要給自己獎勵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA621152AA529B904E982D4E86FF0C000A62404EE589817D6681EA5DF1734E52F530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我滿腦子都在想\n員工餐的事。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116EFF81665B5090FD572860F3000A54E15DE5991076844E8B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從年輕時就接觸貨真價實的事物是很重要的。\n不要客氣，多吃一點吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E5E748F1566425C3163A589F88CA8771F50F95BE676844E8B7269662F5F8891CD898176843002000A4E0D89815BA26C23FF0C591A54034E009EDE542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃飯重要的是跟誰一起吃喔。\n只要不是不好吃的店，哪裡都沒關係。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540398EF91CD89817684662F8DDF8AB04E008D77540355943002000A53EA89814E0D662F4E0D597D540376845E97FF0C54EA88E190FD6C9295DC4FC230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一旦知道鼎極餐館的滋味，\n可就沒辦法對其他餐廳感到滿足了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0065E677E590539F0E69759910992876846ECB5473FF0C000A53EF5C316C928FA66CD55C0D51764ED699105EF3611F52306EFF8DB34E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道鼎極餐館的味道後，\n就能分辨其他料理是什麼水準了喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590539F0E6975991099287684547390535F8CFF0C000A5C3180FD52068FA851764ED665997406662F4EC09EBC6C346E964E86559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    }
  ],
